🚗 SmartPark -- Smart Parking Management System
SmartPark is a web-based Smart Parking Management System developed
using Java, Apache Tomcat, MySQL, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The
application helps customers find and book parking slots, manage their
bookings, and make payments. It also provides administration features to
manage parking operations and monitor payments.
📌 Project Overview
Finding and managing parking spaces can be time-consuming, especially
when slot availability is not known in advance. SmartPark provides a
simple web-based platform where customers can register, log in, view
parking slot availability, book a slot, and view their booking and
payment history.

The system also includes administrative features for monitoring
bookings, managing parking slots, and tracking payment information.
🎯 Objectives
- Simplify the process of parking slot booking.
- Display parking slot availability.
- Maintain customer and booking details.
- Provide a convenient payment-record management system.
- Help administrators monitor parking operations.
✨ Features
👤 Customer Module
- Customer registration and login.
- Customer dashboard.
- View available parking slots.
- Select a parking slot and enter vehicle details.
- Book a parking slot.
- View booking history.
- Make and view payment records.
- View booking and payment status.
🛠️ Admin Module
- Admin dashboard.
- View parking and booking information.
- Manage parking slots.
- View payment records.
- Monitor total payments, payment amount, pending payments, and
  completed payments.
👨‍💼 Staff Module
- Staff login interface.
- Staff-related access to the parking management system.
Note: The available modules and permissions depend on the
implementation included in the repository.

