⚙️ Software Requirements
Install the following software before running the project:
1. Java JDK 17 or compatible JDK.
2. Apache Tomcat 9.
3. MySQL Server.
4. MySQL Workbench (recommended).
5. Visual Studio Code or another Java-compatible IDE.
6. MySQL Connector/J JDBC driver.
